#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.rst:2127
msgid ""
"The pointer argument can be a global pointer (``addrspace(1)``) or a flat "
"pointer (``addrspace(0)``). Global pointers select ``global_load``/ "
"``global_store`` instructions; flat pointers select ``flat_load``/ "
