#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.rst:2277
msgid "DMA Intrinsics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.rst:2279
msgid ""
"DMA intrinsics transfer data between global memory and LDS without occupying "
"registers. See :ref:`amdgpu-dma-operations` for full documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.rst:2291
msgid "Tensor Intrinsics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.rst:2293
msgid ""
"Tensor intrinsics transfer data between global memory and LDS using a tensor "
"descriptor. Despite the absence of ``.async`` in their names, these "
"intrinsics are asynchronous. See :ref:`amdgpu-dma-operations` for full "
"documentation."
msgstr ""

